{
    "title": "Place refinement (OpenStreetMap)",
    "description": "Every hour at :15: refines up to 600 canonical places (most visited first) with Nominatim reverse geocoding: OSM POI name, street, house number, postcode, suburb and city. At most one request per second; each place is written immediately, so runs can be aborted and resume where they stopped. Data © OpenStreetMap contributors, ODbL 1.0.",
